+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-6308,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-6308-GATE-REPLAY,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-6308-FOLD-ISOLATION,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-6308-NO-REFIT-DEFAULT-OFF,
